A shop chain: 4 regions x 5 categories = 20 cells, 14 months.
Most months one cell collapses. The process looks every month,
and because it looks every month it declares repetitions: 12 (R18).

=== PART 1: month 2, and R5 will not let it act

  month 2: North/Outdoor clears at z -5.01
  decision: send a manager, expected value 9308, assurance 0.9
  would it run? false -- needs rehearsal
    this process has never been replayed against history, so nothing is known about how often it fires or how often it is wrong (design R5)

  The finding is real and the decision is sound, and nothing runs.
  A process that has never been replayed against history has no
  evidence about its own behaviour, so it may not act (R5). Note
  this is checked BEFORE authority: approval would not help.

=== PART 2: the rehearsal

  Replayed over 12 periods, fired 9 times, 2 of them false alarms.
  That clears the authority's min_rehearsal_periods of 6.

=== PART 3: the live months

  month  finding                    verdict        action
  3      East/Home (z -3.92)        ordinary       none
  4      South/Grocery (z -3.51)    ordinary       none
  5      West/Apparel (z -3.47)     ordinary       none
  6      North/Electronics (z -5.28)act            HELD BACK
  7      East/Outdoor (z -5.43)     act            HELD BACK
  8      South/Home (z -5.87)       act            executed: true
  9      West/Grocery (z -4.46)     ordinary       none
  10     North/Apparel (z -4.71)    act            executed: true
  11     East/Electronics (z -4.35) ordinary       none
  12     South/Outdoor (z -6.23)    act            executed: true
  13     South/Outdoor (z 4.31)     ordinary       none

  acted on 3 cells, deliberately held back 2 (automation.assign, 30%)
  controlled evidence collected: 3

=== PART 4: the loop turns

  calibrated from 3 controlled outcomes: 0.374  [0.331, 0.417]
  about: send a manager on revenue

  Month 13, where nothing cleared, cannot be decided at all:
    decision.evaluate: sized off the leading_cell, which this finding did not establish -- the leading cell does not clear the threshold for a search of 20 cells. Size off something the evidence supports, or gather more evidence (design R9)

  Month 12 did clear. The SAME finding, decided under the invented
  range recipe 5 used and under the measured one:

  sensitivity_range [0, 2]    send a manager   assurance 0.9
                              over [0, 2]
                              from a range the caller declared

  the calibrated interval     send a manager   assurance 1
                              over [0.885, 1.115]
                              from the calibrated interval, from 3 controlled outcomes

  The recommendation is the same and what is KNOWN about it is not.
  That is the loop closing: the assumption stopped being a number
  somebody chose and became one this business measured about
  itself, under a comparison it deliberately arranged.

=== PART 5: what one Action turned out to carry

  the finding it came from     revenue, z -5.87
    which established           leading_cell = -17128
  the decision that chose it   send a manager
    assured over               a range the caller declared
  the policy that permitted it spend limit 5000, rehearsal >= 6
  the authority it spent       within delegated authority
  the rehearsal it rested on   12 periods, 9 firings
  what the executor reported   dispatched: send a manager

  Every line of that came out of the run. No part of this Action was
  written by hand, which had never been true before.
